    "innovation": "Using a coupled climate model without unphysical flux adjustments, this paper demonstrates that increased atmospheric CO2 causes a collapse of thermohaline circulation in the Labrador Sea while deep-water formation north of the Greenland-Iceland-Scotland ridge remains stable, revealing a distinct and potentially observable pattern of oceanic change.",
