            "paragraph": "The model that we use, HadCM3, is a coupled atmosphere-ocean-sea ice general circulation model developed from an earlier version used extensively for climate studies\u00b9\u00b2. Specific changes include increased ocean horizontal resolution (from 3.75 \u00d7 2.5 degrees longitude \u00d7 latitude to 1.25 \u00d7 1.25 degrees), and inclusion of a modified convection scheme in regions of dense overflows\u00b9\u00b3 and the Gent-McWilliams\u00b9\u2074 adiabatic diffusion scheme.",
